    "detailed_description": "This is an idle copper mining smelting production game.<br><br>Simulate the process of collecting and transporting copper mines to smelting them into copper plates.<br>The gameplay is simple, just click the button to produce, you can buy and upgrade the quantity of production equipment.<br>The first is to dig coal by hand, shovel, construction team, and shearer to dig the coal mine.<br>Coal mines can be resold for gold, upgraded with gold, and purchased equipment.<br><br>Copper mining equipment includes copper drilling machine, blasting machine, excavator, truck, warehouse<br>Crusher, ball mill, classifier, smelting, flotation, electrolysis, etc.<br>Game items also have chalcopyrite, black copper ore, gravel, a truckload of gravel, copper plate<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How to play</h2>Reasonably configure the number of devices and turn off excess device consumption<br>Constantly unlock new equipment and increase copper mine production.<br>Your purpose is to hang up to produce copper plates and upgrade equipment.",
